  "note": "The continent of Nymara: a great lake ringed by eleven regions with Four Gates at its centre. Every exterior-to-exterior transition is declared once, here, as a pair of portal ids; each region's package carries the matching portal (position and server tile) under its own id, and tools/continent_portals.py joins the two into the server's portal table. Interior doors are the region packages' own.",
